# Optional. A GitHub fine-grained personal access token scoped to
# "Public Repositories (read-only)" — https://github.com/settings/personal-access-tokens/new
# Raises the GitHub API rate limit from 60 to 5,000 requests/hour and is required
# for the projects page's commit-count filter to run safely against many repos.
# The site works without it, just at the lower unauthenticated rate limit.
GITHUB_TOKEN=
